// pii-extra.txt (one regular expression per line — client-supplied).
// A line that starts with # is a comment; every other line is a Python
// regular expression.  PdfCraft's redact_mark `find` is a literal search, so
// the pipeline resolves each expression against the page text and then asks
// the engine for the rectangles of the literal it matched.
Matter 4421\-[A-Z]{2}
ACME\-CONF\-\d{4}
